! This test calculates the spin-orbit components of the 2P state of Fluorine,
! using a CISD wavefunction.
! 
! Three different Hamiltonians are used: the four-comonent Dirac-Coulomb (DC) one,
! the two-component infinite order (BSS) one and two-component mean-field screened
! infinite order (BSS+MFSSO) Hamiltonian.
!
!  Hamiltonian     The calculated splittings(in cm-1)
! ==========================================================
!       DC                45.42
!    BSS+MFSSO            47.52
!      BSS               192.83
!
